{"id":"e5bae40b51bec4fe6ed55cadf322fafac2a096ec","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1244589","title":"M5 64G 的 Mac mini 可以买来跑本地模型吗？","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"yexiaoqi","excerpt":"问与答 - @yexiaoqi - 有懂的大哥 聊一聊","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>有懂的大哥 聊一聊</p></div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/Mac\"><li></li> Mac</a><a href=\"/tag/模型\"><li></li> 模型</a><a href=\"/tag/本地\"><li></li> 本地</a></P><p><span>16 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-09-25 01:26:58 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18125216\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7a63/89c4/402108_normal.png?m=1611300501\" alt=\"a970891\" data-uid=\"402108\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/a970891\">a970891</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 16:51:40 +08:00\">19h 36m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>可以，玩具性质，tok/s 很低；建议有条件还是上 spark</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18125336\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7aee/26c3/2719_normal.png?m=1783137169\" alt=\"loading\" data-uid=\"2719\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/loading\">loading</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 17:10:45 +08:00\">19h 17m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>树莓派也能跑，就是跑多大模型，跑多快的区别。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18125374\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7c49/4a43/93623_normal.png?m=1709687727\" alt=\"Eleutherios\" data-uid=\"93623\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Eleutherios\">Eleutherios</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 17:19:35 +08:00\">19h 8m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>内存带宽太低，不支持 FP8/FP4 ，不值得买</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18125378\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d62b/f1c0/410227_normal.png?m=1758866244\" alt=\"hshe\" data-uid=\"410227\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/hshe\">hshe</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 17:20:00 +08:00\">19h 8m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>跑不了的，太烫了。可以试着改造散热看看</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18125394\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/022e/17ea/39164_normal.png?m=1646214419\" alt=\"bzw875\" data-uid=\"39164\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/bzw875\">bzw875</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 17:22:35 +08:00\">19h 5m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>OK ，看来下一个 MacBook 16G 够用了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18125615\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/8f0f/97fd/59413_normal.png?m=1783997072\" alt=\"ares001\" data-uid=\"59413\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ares001\">ares001</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 18:18:22 +08:00\">18h 10m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>显存带宽不够，速度起不来。内存大也是白搭</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18125741\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/aa42/9cdd/198842_normal.png?m=1726974553\" alt=\"oldlamp\" data-uid=\"198842\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/oldlamp\">oldlamp</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 19:21:17 +08:00\">17h 7m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>如果是 27b 的稠密模型，速度还不如 7900xtx ，同样预算下如果有两个 R9700 也是不错的选择。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18125912\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b0b6/208d/209640_normal.png?m=1774107477\" alt=\"usVexMownCzar\" data-uid=\"209640\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/usVexMownCzar\">usVexMownCzar</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 21:08:52 +08:00\">15h 19m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>跑的了的，我的 M4pro 64G 当年买了就能跑，去 hugging face 上找那种不是很大的模型，跑一跑就行，gpt-oss 这个也行，<br>生成图不太行，非常耗内存</p><p>2 年前玩的，现在应该要比我玩的时候简单点，也对 macOS 有了不小的优化</p><p>玩一玩呗，又没啥风险，内存爆了，程序自己就停了。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18125922\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/30c1/8a27/42539_normal.png?m=1787025131\" alt=\"ashong\" data-uid=\"42539\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ashong\">ashong</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 21:13:15 +08:00\">15h 15m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>看了几个视频，M6 跑 Qwen3.8 27B Q4 量化，才 9 ～ 10 t/s ， 太慢了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18125923\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b0b6/208d/209640_normal.png?m=1774107477\" alt=\"usVexMownCzar\" data-uid=\"209640\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/usVexMownCzar\">usVexMownCzar</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 21:13:25 +08:00\">15h 14m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>哦，现在 hugging face 上有检测你的设备能不能跑你选择的模型的功能，非常的省事。无非就是慢。</p><p>市面上的你得看价格，我觉得 64G 的 Mac mini 算是性价比最高之一，而且还有苹果的售后。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18126245\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/c224/2415/578997_normal.png?m=1774247744\" alt=\"AmericanExpr